    "title": "MOC contender completes wild sprint triple, leads standout performances from GMC Red & White Meet - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Corey Annan ,\n1 days ago Some of the best talent in the Greater Middlesex Conference converged onto East Brunswick on Tuesday for the annual Red & White Division championship meet. Division champions weren’t officially crowned yet, as the pole vault was not contested on Tuesday. Marks in that event from the GMC Championships will finalize the division champions. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
